      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A study of the evaluation of postoperative pain in 210 children using physiological, reference and observation methods. A comparison with other methods leads to the conclusion that observation is the best choice and that some children do not need analgesics during the postoperative period."},
